**Q: How do I verify Anrok is working?**

After generating and finalizing an invoice, check the Stripe invoice object. You should see:

```json theme={null}
{
  "automatic_tax": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "anrok",
    "disabled_reason": null,
    "liability": {
      "type": "self"
    },
    "status": "complete"
  }
}
```

If you see `"enabled": false` or `"provider": null`, the integration isn't active. Verify the [Anrok app is installed](https://marketplace.stripe.com/apps/anrok) in Stripe. Otherwise, contact us via the [Metronome support portal](https://support.metronome.com/) for tax automation.

**Q: Do I need to set a default tax behavior in Stripe?**

In the Stripe dashboard, make sure that you have a default tax behavior selected to ensure tax is correctly added to each invoice.
